"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless sedang ditingkatkan, dan ciri-cirinya berubah dengan pantas.** Semasa fasa pembangunan ini, dapatkan nota keluaran dan dokumentasi terkini di halaman [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section explores how to use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to list programs available in Qiskit Serverless, pass inputs into these programs, run them remotely, check their status, and retrieve results and logs.\n"
msgstr "Bahagian ini meneroka cara menggunakan `qiskit-ibm-catalog` untuk menyenaraikan program yang tersedia dalam Qiskit Serverless, menghantar input ke program ini, menjalankannya dari jauh, menyemak status, dan mendapatkan semula keputusan dan log.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Be sure you have followed the workflow in [Write your first Qiskit Serverless program](/guides/serverless-first-program) before you begin.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan anda telah mengikuti aliran kerja dalam [Tulis program Qiskit Serverless pertama anda](/guides/serverless-first-program) sebelum anda bermula.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List programs available {#list-programs-available}"
msgstr "Senaraikan program yang tersedia {#list-programs-available}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `QiskitServerless.list()` to fetch a list of the available programs to run with Qiskit Serverless. This includes the previously uploaded [`transpile_remote_serverless`](/guides/serverless-first-program).\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan `QiskitServerless.list()` untuk mendapatkan senarai program yang tersedia untuk dijalankan dengan Qiskit Serverless. Ini termasuk [`transpile_remote_serverless`](/guides/serverless-first-program) yang dimuat naik sebelumnya.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run an uploaded program and pass inputs {#run-an-uploaded-program-and-pass-inputs}"
msgstr "Jalankan program yang dimuat naik dan hantar input {#run-an-uploaded-program-and-pass-inputs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, set up your inputs. Your program has three inputs: `circuits`, `backend`, and `optimization_level`. You can use `random_circuit` to create 30 random circuits:\n"
msgstr "Pertama, sediakan input anda. Program anda mempunyai tiga input: `circuits`, `backend`, dan `optimization_level`. Anda boleh menggunakan `random_circuit` untuk mencipta 30 Circuit rawak:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/serverless-run-first-workload/extracted-outputs/46108a95-11f8-4ecf-83bb-131c3e7ea4c2-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/serverless-run-first-workload/extracted-outputs/46108a95-11f8-4ecf-83bb-131c3e7ea4c2-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, use `QiskitRuntimeService` and `least_busy` to select a `backend`:\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, gunakan `QiskitRuntimeService` dan `least_busy` untuk memilih `backend`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set your optimization level:\n"
msgstr "Tetapkan tahap pengoptimuman anda:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select your program with `serverless.load('PROGRAM_NAME')`:\n"
msgstr "Pilih program anda dengan `serverless.load('PROGRAM_NAME')`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, pass your inputs and run it in a pythonic fashion as follows:\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, hantar input anda dan jalankannya dalam gaya Pythonic seperti berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"serverless-job-status\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"serverless-job-status\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check job status {#check-job-status}"
msgstr "Semak status kerja {#check-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With your Qiskit Serverless `job_id`, you can check the status of running jobs. This includes the following statuses:\n"
msgstr "Dengan `job_id` Qiskit Serverless anda, anda boleh menyemak status kerja yang sedang berjalan. Ini termasuk status berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`QUEUED`**: The remote program is in the Qiskit Serverless queue. The queue priority is currently based on how much you've used Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "**`QUEUED`**: Program jauh berada dalam barisan Qiskit Serverless. Keutamaan barisan pada masa ini berdasarkan sejauh mana anda telah menggunakan Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`INITIALIZING`**: The remote program is starting; this includes setting up the remote environment and installing dependencies\n"
msgstr "**`INITIALIZING`**: Program jauh sedang dimulakan; ini termasuk menyediakan persekitaran jauh dan memasang kebergantungan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING`**: The program is running. At this stage, if you have `print()` outputs in your program, you can retrieve logs using `job.logs()`\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING`**: Program sedang berjalan. Pada peringkat ini, jika anda mempunyai output `print()` dalam program anda, anda boleh mendapatkan semula log menggunakan `job.logs()`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`DONE`**: The program is complete, and you can retrieve data stored in `save_result()` with `job.results()`\n"
msgstr "**`DONE`**: Program selesai, dan anda boleh mendapatkan semula data yang disimpan dalam `save_result()` dengan `job.results()`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also set more detailed job statuses in [Manage Qiskit Serverless compute and data resources](/guides/serverless-manage-resources).\n"
msgstr "Anda juga boleh menetapkan status kerja yang lebih terperinci dalam [Urus sumber pengkomputeran dan data Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless-manage-resources).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
#| "Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects Qiskit Runtime workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects IBM Quantum Compute Service workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Pada masa ini, jadual beban kerja IBM Quantum hanya mencerminkan beban kerja Qiskit Runtime. Gunakan `job.status()` untuk melihat status semasa beban kerja Qiskit Serverless anda.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You've successfully run your first Qiskit Serverless program!\n"
msgstr "Anda telah berjaya menjalankan program Qiskit Serverless pertama anda!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve logs and results {#retrieve-logs-and-results}"
msgstr "Dapatkan semula log dan keputusan {#retrieve-logs-and-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As mentioned before, once a program is `RUNNING`, you can use `job.logs()` to fetch logs created from `print()` outputs:\n"
msgstr "Seperti yang disebutkan sebelumnya, sebaik sahaja program berada dalam status `RUNNING`, anda boleh menggunakan `job.logs()` untuk mendapatkan log yang dibuat daripada output `print()`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At any time, you can also cancel a job:\n"
msgstr "Pada bila-bila masa, anda juga boleh membatalkan kerja:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.results()` to fetch the result stored in `save_result()`:\n"
msgstr "Setelah program berada dalam status `DONE`, anda boleh menggunakan `job.results()` untuk mendapatkan keputusan yang disimpan dalam `save_result()`:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List jobs previously run with Qiskit Serverless {#list-jobs-previously-run-with-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Senaraikan kerja yang pernah dijalankan dengan Qiskit Serverless {#list-jobs-previously-run-with-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `jobs()` to list all jobs submitted to Qiskit Serverless:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan `jobs()` untuk menyenaraikan semua kerja yang dihantar ke Qiskit Serverless:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore [compute and data management tools](/guides/serverless-manage-resources) available to your program, including parallelization.\n"
msgstr "Terokai [alat pengurusan pengkomputeran dan data](/guides/serverless-manage-resources) yang tersedia untuk program anda, termasuk selarian.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr "</Admonition>\n"
